%% Telegram through OAN (no caller in Phase 1)
sequenceDiagram
  autonumber
  participant T as Future Telegram caller (none in Phase 1)
  participant OAN as OAN API
  participant B as Telegram Bot API
  actor F as Farmer (has started the bot)
  T->>OAN: POST /messages/telegram (chat_id, text, purpose)<br/>caller is mapped to ONE bot by the OAN operator
  OAN->>B: sendMessage via that bot
  B->>F: message
  T->>OAN: GET /messages/{id}
  OAN-->>T: sent = final (Telegram never reports delivered)
